{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the food chain in this frantic multiplayer party game for up to 16 players.  Play as a slippery alien worm racing to power generators and escape - or a relentless bird hunting worms to climb the ranks. Outrun, outfly and outplay your friends.  When the dust settles, the leaderboard decides who rules. There\u2019s only one rule in nature: get to the top of the Pecking Order.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Extract or be eaten</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a worm, your only goal is survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect berries, power the generators and extract back to wherever in the Corkscrew Nebula you crawled in from. Dodge dive-bombing birds, weave through hazards and survive the final seconds or become lunch trying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530640/extras/674ec8efe56719a218779529f795b159.poster.avif?t=1773978794\" width=540 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530640/extras/674ec8efe56719a218779529f795b159.webm?t=1773978794\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530640/extras/674ec8efe56719a218779529f795b159.mp4?t=1773978794\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hunt the Helpless</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a bird, your job is simple: don\u2019t let the worms get out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chase them down, grab them mid-sprint and stop them from powering the generators. In Bird society, nothing earns status faster than a successful hunt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530640/extras/e784485bdb21454c4953b118693c115d.poster.avif?t=1773978794\" width=538 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530640/extras/e784485bdb21454c4953b118693c115d.webm?t=1773978794\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530640/extras/e784485bdb21454c4953b118693c115d.mp4?t=1773978794\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Death Is Not the End</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Pecking Order, getting eaten doesn\u2019t mean game over - it means switching sides.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Snatched as a worm? You respawn as a bird, louder, prouder and ready to hunt your former teammates and stop them from extracting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530640/extras/9fd879bae4dc57c5ce58307c432e06f8.poster.avif?t=1773978794\" width=598 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530640/extras/9fd879bae4dc57c5ce58307c432e06f8.webm?t=1773978794\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530640/extras/9fd879bae4dc57c5ce58307c432e06f8.mp4?t=1773978794\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Berries with Benefits</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some berries power generators. Others send players flying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab explosive berries to knock birds off their dive, launch a rival into a hazard or buy yourself just enough space to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530640/extras/c041c5c1c9a333976cb67691bf8365e4.poster.avif?t=1773978794\" width=600 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530640/extras/c041c5c1c9a333976cb67691bf8365e4.webm?t=1773978794\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530640/extras/c041c5c1c9a333976cb67691bf8365e4.mp4?t=1773978794\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Nature Is Your Playground</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every map is packed with bounce pads, hazards and ridiculous physics moments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leap, hide, and scramble through chaotic outdoor arenas where nothing (and no one) plays fair.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530640/extras/5562e688c465ed49d55f1d96d2134794.poster.avif?t=1773978794\" width=600 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530640/extras/5562e688c465ed49d55f1d96d2134794.webm?t=1773978794\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530640/extras/5562e688c465ed49d55f1d96d2134794.mp4?t=1773978794\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Show Off Your Style</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Birds chase status. Worms chase power. But we all chase fashion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock cosmetics, emotes and achievements and show off your slimy style or feathered flair when you reach the top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530640/extras/7a6aeb4242e01260c523dcbb221ab5bd.poster.avif?t=1773978794\" width=524 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530640/extras/7a6aeb4242e01260c523dcbb221ab5bd.webm?t=1773978794\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530640/extras/7a6aeb4242e01260c523dcbb221ab5bd.mp4?t=1773978794\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play with (and against) Friends</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump into Quickplay, form private lobbies with up to 16 players or queue as a party with up to 4 friends.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3530640?t=1773978794","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530640/1e24d59c2453399eec4a72d2d0bce8c06ffc5b24/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773978794","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530640/d23f844fa7b9f62f3afed48f221b04af4db9020b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773978794","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530640/d23f844fa7b9f62f3afed48f221b04af4db9020b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773978794","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the food chain in this frantic multiplayer party game for up to 16 players.  Play as a slippery alien worm racing to power generators and escape - or a relentless bird hunting worms to climb the ranks. Outrun, outfly and outplay your friends.  When the dust settles, the leaderboard decides who rules. There\u2019s only one rule in nature: get to the top of the Pecking Order.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Extract or be eaten</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a worm, your only goal 