1080.jpg?t=1773978794","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530640/08878ba03292fbc2d7f671729e0fad8ea47a58f4/ss_08878ba03292fbc2d7f671729e0fad8ea47a58f4.600x338.jpg?t=1773978794"},{"id":9,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530640/f49d8a7943c4700f236348102570dbd8a6e7622f/ss_f49d8a7943c4700f236348102570dbd8a6e7622f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1773978794","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3530640/f49d8a7943c4700f236348102570dbd8a6e7622f/ss_f49d8a7943c4700f236348102570dbd8a6e7622f.600x338.jpg?t=1773978794"}],"short_description":"Run, fly and scream your way through the food chain in this chaotic party game for up to 16 players, where sneaky worms outsmart hungry birds in a frantic fight for survival and bragging rights. Think you can climb your way to the top of the Pecking Order?","steam_appid":3530640,"support_info":{"email":"info@talentdigital.art","url":"www.talentdigital.art"},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Russian, Spanish - Latin America, Turkish, Portuguese - Brazil, Simplified Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":"https://www.talentdigital.art/our-games/pecking-order/"}